Error [E0119]: There's no type called `MissingRow`
  --> sql_row_header_is_a_real_declared_type_position.jet:1:17
    |
  1 | fn run() { #SQL(MissingRow) {} }
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The types are `Int`, `Float`, `Bool`, and `String` (plus types you define)
 Fix: Check the spelling, or define the struct or enum first
